From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Feb 2026 21:08:02 +0530
Subject: Extend UAOverrideManager with network, GPU, storage, and battery
 overrides

Add network connection fields (type, effectiveType, rtt, downlink, saveData),
GPU renderer/vendor strings, and storage quota to UAOverrideValues. These are
stored via setUA() and read by ForBinding methods across all worker types for
consistent fingerprinting.

NetworkInformation: 5 ForBinding methods (type, effectiveType, rtt, downlink,
saveData) now check UAOverrideManager before falling back to customOverrides.

WebGL: getParameterForBinding checks UAOverrideManager for RENDERER (0x9245)
and VENDOR (0x9246) pnames in both standard and WebGPU-backed contexts.

StorageManager: estimate() callback checks UAOverrideManager for quota override.

BatteryManager: Add ForBinding hooks for charging, chargingTime, dischargingTime,
and level properties via customOverrides.batteryManager interface. IDL updated
with CallWith=ScriptState and ImplementedAs annotations.

